[NAME]
sshnpd \- NoPorts SSH daemon
[EXAMPLES]
.nf
sshnpd -a @alice_device -m @alice_client -d my_server
.fi
[SEE ALSO]
sshnp(1), npt(1), srv(1), srvd(1), at_activate(1)
.PP
Full documentation at <https://docs.noports.com/>
